															<div class="game_description_snippet">
									This is a open world hunting simulation. Hunt some of North Americas best hunting spots for trophy Whitetail Deer, Mule Deer, and more to come soon! Manage and grow your bucks from one year to the next. Hunt with multiple firearms including compound bows, Rifle, Shotgun &amp; Muzzleloader.  								</div>
