			<p><i>
					Generative AI was used to create select visual assets, including loading screen illustrations, Steam achievement artwork, and promotional backgrounds. These assets were generated during development and are not generated dynamically during gameplay.				</i>
			</p>
					</div>
	</div>
	
				
				
